      "text": "Most branches of Christianity consider Jesus the incarnation of God the Son and the awaited Messiah or Christ. Accounts of Jesus's life are contained in the Gospels, especially the four canonical Gospels of the New Testament."
    },
    {
      "citation_id": "c1",
      "cluster_id": null,
      "est_tokens": 20,
      "formulas": [],
      "heading_path": [],
      "id": "1382805013:lead:facts",
      "kind": "facts",
      "links": [],
      "order": 1,
      "relevance": 1.0,
      "text": "Born: c. 6 to 4 BC, Herodian kingdom, Roman Empire\nCause of death: Crucifixion"
    },
    {
      "citation_id": "c3",
      "cluster_id": 0,
      "est_tokens": 16,
