      "links": [],
      "order": 0,
      "relevance": 0.9,
      "text": "Jesus's childhood home is identified in the Gospels of Luke and Matthew as Nazareth, a town in Galilee in present-day Israel, where he lived with his family."
    },
    {
      "citation_id": "c3",
      "cluster_id": 0,
