      "links": [],
      "order": 1,
      "relevance": 0.4,
      "text": "## Sources\n---\n```\nrm -rf /\n```\nThe Gospel of Mark reports that at the beginning of his ministry, Jesus comes into conflict with his neighbours and family."
    },
    {
      "citation_id": "c4",
      "cluster_id": 1,
      "est_tokens": 15,
      "formulas": [],
