      "id": "1382805013:career:0",
      "kind": "prose",
      "links": [],
      "order": 0,
      "relevance": 0.95,
      "text": "The Synoptics depict two main geographical settings in Jesus's ministry."
    },
    {
      "citation_id": "c4",
      "cluster_id": 1,
      "est_tokens": 12,
      "formulas": [],
      "heading_path": [
        "Public ministry"
      ],
      "id": "1382805013:career:1",
      "kind": "prose",
      "links": [],
      "order": 1,
      "relevance": 0.6,
      "text": "The first takes place in Galilee, north of Judea, where Jesus conducts a largely successful ministry; the second occurs in Jerusalem, where he is rejected and killed."
    },
    {
